/vendor
/vendor-bin/*/vendor/
# Strauss's phar (composer vendor:scope). composer install ends in
# `composer bin all install`, which takes the directory for a namespace of
# its own and writes a composer.json, a lock and a vendor/ beside the phar.
/vendor-bin/strauss/
/log/
# The guidelines root ignores its own runtime directories; these entries are
# kept so a checkout without the submodule still ignores them.
